Package: trend.sst
Title: Daily SST Sufficient Statistics on S2 Cells
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Michael", "Sumner", email = "mdsumner@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Area-weighted daily sea surface temperature aggregated to a
    global S2 discrete grid as sufficient statistics (count, summed
    weights, weighted sums and sums of squares), from OISST and GHRSST
    MUR sources. Any region is a cell selection; any mean, variance, or
    rollup is exact arithmetic on the sums.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: s2, vapour, vaster, arrow, dplyr
Suggests: sds, mirai
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
